{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t消防人員凌晨於深水埗福榮街一幢大廈外牆簷篷，架起雲梯救出一隻被困的貓，已聯同愛護動物協會職員將貓隻帶回安全地方。<br/>\n<br/>\n消防表示，經檢查後貓隻身體無大礙，並提醒公眾如果發現有動物被困危險位置，切勿冒險營救，可以聯絡消防處或相關部門求助。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:24:56.883873+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:55:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:52:40.797677+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T03:18:23.838444+00:00","content_hash":"e1b40591989c9c98a847217bf7b47cb6d3ea52569d7a1203e7c109ecf94c9436","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}